<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="keywords" content="诗歌">
    <title>元日</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background:#F4F4F4
        }

        hr {
            border:#F0A95D 3px dotted
        }

        .poem p {
            color:#CA000B;
            font-family:"仿宋";
            font-size:20px;
        }

        .poem-style {
            background:url(./002.png) no-repeat left
        }

        table {
            border:none;
            margin:0 auto
        }

        td {
            border:none;
            vertical-align:middle;
            padding:20px
        }

        a {
            color:red;
            text-decoration:none
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration:underline
        }
    </style>
</head> 
<body>
    <div><h1 align="center">元日</h1></div>
    <div><h3 align="center">宋代：王安石</h3></div>
    
    <hr>
    
    <table align="center">
        <tr>
            <td class="poem-style">
                <div class="poem">
                    <p>爆竹声中一岁除，</p>
                    <p>春风送暖入屠苏。</p>
                    <p>千门万户曈曈日，</p>
                    <p>总把新桃换旧符。</p>
                </div>
            </td>
            <td>
                <img src="./001.png" width="500px">
            </td>
        </tr>
